            "from": "nurse",
            "text": "You disconnect the ventilator. A prolonged, continuous rush of air escapes from the endotracheal tube over 15 seconds. Blood pressure rises quickly from 82/50 to 112/70 mmHg, and heart rate settles to 102 bpm."
